msgid "Estonian also has a third, extra-long length, and the spelling doesn’t always show it. <0>Linna</0> means both “of the town” and “into the town”, and the second is held longer."
msgstr "Estonian also has a third, extra-long length, and the spelling doesn’t always show it. <0>Linna</0> means both “of the town” and “into the town”, and the second is held longer."

msgid "Estonian is spelled the way it sounds. You say every letter, and each one keeps its sound wherever it stands. Once you know the letters, you can read a new word aloud."
msgstr "Estonian is spelled the way it sounds. You say every letter, and each one keeps its sound wherever it stands. Once you know the letters, you can read a new word aloud."

